Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.96,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fn悠哉字体\fscx70\fscy70\pos(46,41)\c&H141414&}Hello, Renji! 你好，蓮司！\NThanks again for getting me that pen yesterday - I've already started using it!\N再次謝謝你昨天幫我弄到那支筆，我已經開始用它了！\NTry looking at it from a different angle... it shimmers in all these lovely colours, doesn't it? I'll let you borrow it sometime.\N如果試著以不同的角度觀察它的話……看起來流光溢彩的，對吧！我會不時地借給你用的！\Npromise!\N約好了！\NAoi-chan has one just like it, and I really wanted one too, so I'm absolutely chuffed I've got it now!\N因為小葵有個一樣的，所以我也很想要一支，所以現在有了這支筆，我特別特別開心！\NOh, Aoi-chan's the girl who came along to the arcade with us the other day - remember her? That's her!\N哦，小葵就是那天和我們去遊戲廳的那個女孩子，還記得嗎？就是她！\N... ve grown quite close recently. She's such a lovely girl, and... ever so helpful with school and all sorts.\N……最近和我關係很融洽。她真的是個很可愛的女孩子！而且……對學校裡的還有各式各樣的事情都幫大忙了！\N... a bit more with some of my classmates... this notebook - it's been a...\N……還有一些關於我同學的事……這本筆記本，是……
