Dialogue: 8,0:11:43.22,0:11:46.35,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}You always end up spending all your pocket money at arcades!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.94,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}但是我……
Dialogue: 8,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.94,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}But I...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.27,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}好了 給
Dialogue: 8,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.27,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}はい どうぞ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.54,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1008)}就 就剛才那一瞬間就夾到了？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.54,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}い 今の一瞬で？
