Dialogue: 8,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.37,Text_Bottom,,0,0,0,fx,{\pos(960,1050)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}いつもゲーセンに来てもらってるお礼だよ
Dialogue: 9,0:12:04.37,0:12:05.29,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,918)}我可以收下嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:04.37,0:12:05.29,Text_Bottom,,0,0,120,fx,{\pos(960,960)\fscx67\fscy67\fn獅尾圓體JP-Bold}Can I?
